# opusfree AI brain — paste ONE free key here, then rename this file to ".env".
# This turns on Opus-style AI clip selection (a language model reads the whole
# transcript and picks the genuinely viral moments). Pick ONE:

# 1) Google Gemini — RECOMMENDED, free, strong. Get a key in ~30s:
#    https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# GEMINI_API_KEY=your_key_here

# 2) Groq — free, very fast (Llama-3.3-70B). Get a key:
#    https://console.groq.com/keys
# GROQ_API_KEY=your_key_here

# 3) OpenAI (paid). https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
# OPENAI_API_KEY=your_key_here

# Real B-roll overlays — free stock footage from Pexels (no card):
#    https://www.pexels.com/api/
# PEXELS_API_KEY=your_key_here

# Optional overrides:
# OPUSFREE_LLM_PROVIDER=gemini      # force a provider
# OPUSFREE_LLM_MODEL=gemini-2.5-flash
